ok - worker commits but does not push -> done refused
ok - worker pushes but opens no PR -> done refused for ship tasks
ok - worker pushes and opens a PR the forge confirms -> done accepted
ok - worker names a PR but never pushes its own branch -> done refused
ok - worker names a PR in another repository -> done refused
ok - worker names a PR the forge reports closed -> done refused
ok - forge unreachable -> done refused rather than accepted on the claim
ok - scout and local-only dones are skipped
ok - a recorded worktree that is not a checkout skips the gate
ok - PR merges after done and the merge is recorded -> done accepted, offline too
ok - fleet sync prunes a merged branch -> the recorded merge still accepts the done
ok - merge receipt names a different PR -> done still refused
ok - gerrit change's current patch set carries HEAD -> done accepted in both ship modes
ok - gerrit change stale, abandoned, or unreadable -> done refused
ok - classifier drops a refused ship done from the actionable span
ok - apply refuses an unpushed done and steers the worker to push
ok - watcher drops an unpushed ship done from the captain's wake queue and steers the crewmate
